<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber ups IBM estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber ups IBM estimate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Stephen Smith said he raised his 1997 earnings estimate on International Business Machines Corp to $11.30 a share from $11.12 to reflect a lower tax rate in the year.</p>
<p>-- However, Smith said he remains concerned about long-term growth prospects and expects IBM to generate less gross profits from mainframe computers in 1997.</p>
<p>-- He reiterated an unattractive rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- IBM shares were off 9-1/2 at 158-5/8 in heavy trade.</p>
</text>
